sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant ORQ as Saga Orchestrator
    participant INV as Inventory Service
    participant PAY as Payment Service
    participant GW as Gateway externo

    Note over C,GW: Setas sólidas (->>) = chamada síncrona. Setas abertas (-)) = mensagem assíncrona via broker.

    C->>OS: POST /orders (Idempotency-Key)
    activate OS
    OS->>OS: Tx local: INSERT order(PENDING) + saga_instance(STARTED) + outbox(OrderCreated)
    OS-->>C: 202 Accepted {orderId, sagaId}
    deactivate OS

    OS-)ORQ: evt OrderCreated (via outbox)
    ORQ->>ORQ: Estado = STOCK_RESERVING (grava saga_instance + deadline)

    ORQ-)INV: cmd ReserveStock {sagaId, messageId, itens}
    activate INV
    INV->>INV: Dedup (processed_message) + Tx: reserva estoque + outbox
    INV-)ORQ: evt StockReserved
    deactivate INV
    ORQ->>ORQ: Estado = PAYMENT_PROCESSING

    ORQ-)PAY: cmd ProcessPayment {sagaId, messageId, valor}
    activate PAY
    PAY->>PAY: Dedup + grava payment(PROCESSING)
    PAY->>GW: POST /charges (Idempotency-Key = sagaId, timeout 3s)
    GW-->>PAY: 200 approved
    PAY->>PAY: payment(APPROVED) + outbox
    PAY-)ORQ: evt PaymentApproved
    deactivate PAY
    ORQ->>ORQ: Estado = CONFIRMING_STOCK

    ORQ-)INV: cmd ConfirmStock {sagaId, messageId}
    INV->>INV: Dedup + Tx: reserva vira baixa definitiva
    INV-)ORQ: evt StockConfirmed
    ORQ->>ORQ: Estado = APPROVING_ORDER

    ORQ-)OS: cmd ApproveOrder {sagaId, messageId}
    OS->>OS: Dedup + Tx: order = APPROVED
    OS-)ORQ: evt OrderApproved
    ORQ->>ORQ: Estado = COMPLETED (fim da saga)

    C->>OS: GET /orders/{id} (polling ou notificação)
    OS-->>C: 200 {status: APPROVED}
